{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"带基点生象的范畴"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Ani_pt"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>对称幺半结构</h3>\n<p>$\\mathsf{Ani}_*$ 上有压缩积 $\\wedge$ 与带基点映射生象 $[-,-]$ 给出的"},{"Local":{"url":"闭范畴","text":"闭"}},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半∞-范畴","text":"对称幺半"}},{"Plain":"结构.</p>\n"}]}}